+### Voice input, in Simplified Chinese (zh-CN).
+### Drafted with Lara Translate and revised; not reviewed by a native speaker.
+### Glossary: "jail", "sandbox" and "thread" stay in English.
+
+## The composer's button and strip
+
+voice-label = 语音输入
+voice-read-only = 输入框为只读
+voice-busy = 语音输入正在另一个thread中使用
+voice-awaiting-consent = 语音输入正在等待确认下载模型
+voice-downloading = 语音输入正在下载语音模型
+voice-stop-recording = 停止录音
+voice-stop-recording-elapsed = 停止录音（{ $elapsed }）
+voice-transcribing = 正在转写…
+voice-transcribing-aria = 正在转写语音输入
+voice-with-remote = { $text }——远程：{ $host }
+voice-consent = 语音输入需要从{ $host }下载语音模型{ $model }（{ $size }）。要下载吗？
+voice-consent-decline = 暂不
+voice-consent-download = 下载
+voice-download-title = 正在下载语音模型
+voice-download-cancel = 取消
+voice-discarded = 转写内容已丢弃：thread已关闭
+
+## Notices
+
+voice-no-microphone = 没有可用的麦克风：{ $reason }
+voice-microphone-stopped = 麦克风已停止：{ $reason }
+voice-limit-reached = 录音已达2分钟上限并停止
+voice-no-speech = 未识别到语音
+voice-cpu-unsupported = 语音输入需要支持{ $level }的CPU
+voice-model-missing = 缺少语音模型{ $model }；点击麦克风即可重新下载
+voice-model-unreadable = 无法读取语音模型：{ $source }
+voice-model-unreadable-redownload = 无法读取语音模型；下次使用时将重新下载
+voice-model-undeletable = 无法读取语音模型，且无法将其删除（{ $path }）：{ $error }
+voice-local-failed = 本地转写失败
+voice-download-mismatch = 语音模型{ $model }与其校验和不符，已被删除
+voice-download-failed = 无法下载语音模型{ $model }：{ $source }
+voice-download-cancelled = 语音模型{ $model }的下载已取消
+
+## Remote transcription
+
+voice-remote-url-unset = 未设置远程语音URL（voice_input.remote.url）
+voice-remote-url-invalid = 远程语音URL不是有效的URL
+voice-remote-url-not-loopback = 远程语音URL必须使用https：{ $scheme }://{ $host }不是环回地址
+voice-remote-url-scheme = 远程语音URL必须使用https，而不是{ $scheme }（{ $host }）
+voice-remote-url-proxy = 已配置代理，但远程语音URL使用的是明文http；请使用https
+voice-remote-key-invalid = 远程语音API密钥不是有效的HTTP标头值
+voice-remote-timeout = 远程转写在{ $seconds }秒后超时（{ $host }）
+voice-remote-unreachable = 远程转写失败：无法连接{ $host }：{ $error }
+voice-remote-http = 远程转写失败：{ $host }返回HTTP { $status }
+voice-remote-http-excerpt = 远程转写失败：{ $host }返回HTTP { $status }：{ $excerpt }
+voice-remote-read = 远程转写失败：读取{ $host }的响应时出错：{ $error }
+voice-remote-too-large = 远程转写失败：{ $host }返回的转写响应大于1 MiB
+voice-remote-no-text = 远程转写失败：{ $host }的响应中没有JSON `text`字段
